cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or data, please cite the tensorOmics manuscript and this
  repository.
title: "tensorOmics: case studies"
abstract: >-
  Case studies and analysis code accompanying the tensorOmics manuscript. tensorOmics is
  a framework of five tensor methods for exploratory analysis, regression, classification
  and multi-omics integration of longitudinal omics data, implemented in the tensorOmics
  R package.
type: software
# Authors and affiliations as in the manuscript, in manuscript order.
